certforge (0.10.0-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild as a dh-based source package from the release tag, replacing
    the hand-rolled .deb attached to the GitHub release. The timer is
    enabled and started by dh_installsystemd; the oneshot service is
    installed but never started by the package.
  * Build with the rustup stable toolchain: the locked crates need rustc
    1.88 or newer, well past what bookworm packages.

 -- Roman Kivalin <roman@shl.dev>  Tue, 08 Sep 2026 14:40:15 +0200
